      ],
      "en": "Your oils have a pleasing fragrance. Your name is oil poured out, therefore the virgins love you.",
      "ko": "네 기름이 향기로와 아름답고 네 이름이 쏟은 향기름 같으므로 처녀들이 너를 사랑하는구나",
      "source_text_hash": "3365d13e26cededd3d73f30b8996e58e179998bf99d01ff24863bff2052f9f24",
      "translation_text_hash": "5560c3dd9c9603a4567359efa3dbf15bad6ac910127c8fd9138a4ccd1fd2a4b6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
